{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function assertPromptFileSourceSupport(adapter, prompt): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/content-source.ts#L108","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/utilities/content-source.ts:108"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fail-closed preflight for media prompts and embedding inputs\n("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"generateImage"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"generateVideo"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"embed"},{"type":"text","value":"): throws when the input\ncarries a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ type: 'file' }"},{"type":"text","value":" source and the adapter hasn't declared\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"supportsFileSources"},{"type":"text","value":". Runs in the activity dispatcher — the same layer\nthat validates modality — so an adapter that predates the file arm can\nnever receive one. Walks a single part, an array of parts, and nested\narrays (fused embedding items)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"adapter","children":[{"type":"text","value":"adapter"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/FileSourceCapable.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FileSourceCapable"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"prompt","children":[{"type":"text","value":"prompt"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"adapter","text":"adapter","level":3},{"id":"prompt","text":"prompt","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction assertPromptFileSourceSupport(adapter, prompt): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/content-source.ts:108](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/content-source.ts#L108)\n\nFail-closed preflight for media prompts and embedding inputs\n(`generateImage` / `generateVideo` / `embed`): throws when the input\ncarries a `{ type: 'file' }` source and the adapter hasn't declared\n`supportsFileSources`. Runs in the activity dispatcher — the same layer\nthat validates modality — so an adapter that predates the file arm can\nnever receive one. Walks a single part, an array of parts, and nested\narrays (fused embedding items).\n\n## Parameters\n\n### adapter\n\n[`FileSourceCapable`](../interfaces/FileSourceCapable.md)\n\n### prompt\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: assertPromptFileSourceSupport\ntitle: assertPromptFileSourceSupport\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction assertPromptFileSourceSupport(adapter, prompt): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/utilities/content-source.ts:108](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/utilities/content-source.ts#L108)\n\nFail-closed preflight for media prompts and embedding inputs\n(`generateImage` / `generateVideo` / `embed`): throws when the input\ncarries a `{ type: 'file' }` source and the adapter hasn't declared\n`supportsFileSources`. Runs in the activity dispatcher — the same layer\nthat validates modality — so an adapter that predates the file arm can\nnever receive one. Walks a single part, an array of parts, and nested\narrays (fused embedding items).\n\n## Parameters\n\n### adapter\n\n[`FileSourceCapable`](../interfaces/FileSourceCapable.md)\n\n### prompt\n\n`unknown`\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n"}
